      "notes": " Sins of the Broken is a tactical multiplayer first-person shooter. Violence is realistic and player-versus-player: firearms combat, explosions, and structural destruction of the environment.\r\n\r\nInjury is depicted in more detail than is typical for the genre, because treating it is core to how the game is played. Wounded players bleed, and treatment involves identifying and dressing specific wounds, so blood and open injuries are visible during normal play. Players can be incapacitated, bleed out, and be dragged while wounded. There is no sexual content or nudity, and no depiction of sexual assault. There is no drug or alcohol use, and no depiction of self-harm or suicide. There is no single-player storyline; all content takes place in multiplayer matches between human players."
